msgid "Exposure"
msgstr "Belichtung"

#. Setting description (HDR > Shadows > Exposure)
#. Setting description (HDR > Midtones > Exposure)
#. Setting description (HDR > Highlights > Exposure)
msgid ""
"Adjust brightness within this HDR zone in stops. Positive values brighten; "
"negative values darken."
msgstr ""
"Passt die Helligkeit in diesem Tonwertbereich in HDR in Blendenstufen an. "
"Positive Werte hellen auf, negative dunkeln ab."

#. Setting description (HDR > Shadows > Contrast)
#. Setting description (HDR > Midtones > Contrast)
#. Setting description (HDR > Highlights > Contrast)
msgid "Change contrast within this HDR zone. 0 is neutral."
msgstr "Ändert den Kontrast in diesem Tonwertbereich in HDR. 0 ist neutral."

#. Setting description (HDR > Shadows > Saturation)
#. Setting description (HDR > Midtones > Saturation)
#. Setting description (HDR > Highlights > Saturation)
msgid "Change color intensity within this HDR zone. 0 is neutral."
msgstr ""
"Ändert die Farbintensität in diesem Tonwertbereich in HDR. 0 ist neutral."

